     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">At ZOLLER, the focus is on our customers. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">Our exclusive 1:1 expert meetings are individual, customized online appointments with our specialists. You'll learn everything you need to know about CAM to part milling, to turning and grinding – every session is tailored to your manufacturing needs. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">You can also visit our ZOLLER Industry 4.0 Tech Center in Ann Arbor, MI, or the ZOLLER Pacific showroom in California, which offers state-of-the-art training rooms and regular events relating to the ZOLLER solutions world. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">Live presentations from our facilities helps us get in touch with our customers worldwide. Join us as we present our smart manufacturing solutions from art to part – we look forward to seeing you!</p>",
